@startuml Counter
hide empty description
title Counter

[*] --> CounterState

state "CounterState" as CounterState
CounterState : Increment → CounterState
CounterState : Decrement → CounterState
CounterState : SetStep → CounterState ◆ ShowMessage
CounterState : Reset → CounterState ◆ ShowMessage, SaveCount
CounterState : SaveCompleted ◆ ShowMessage
CounterState --> CounterState : Increment
CounterState --> CounterState : Decrement
CounterState --> CounterState : SetStep
CounterState --> CounterState : Reset


@enduml